<title>FINLAND: ALANDSBANKEN SEES HIGHER 1997 EARNINGS.</title>
<headline>ALANDSBANKEN SEES HIGHER 1997 EARNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aland-based Finnish bank said on Thursday it expected full-year earnings to improve this year compared to 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;The result is expected to improve compared to last year,&quot; it said in a statement with its first half earnings, which showed an increase in the operating profit to 38.4 million markka from 27.8 million in the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
